= form_with model: [:admin, @loader], local: true, html: { class: 'admin-registry-form' } do |f|
  - if @loader.errors.any?
    .alert.alert-danger
      %p.fw-semibold.mb-1
        %i.fa-solid.fa-circle-exclamation.me-1{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
        Couldn't save this loader entry.
      %ul.mb-0.small
        - @loader.errors.full_messages.each do |msg|
          %li= msg

  .admin-registry-form__section
    %h3.admin-registry-form__section-title
      %i.fa-solid.fa-id-card{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
      Identity
    .mb-3
      = f.label :slug, class: 'admin-registry-form__label' do
        %i.fa-solid.fa-tag{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
        Slug
      = f.text_field :slug, class: 'form-control admin-registry-form__input--id', placeholder: 'marcom', autocomplete: 'off'
      .admin-registry-form__hint
        The text used in the loader URL. Use only lowercase letters, digits, dashes, and underscores.
    .mb-3
      = f.label :display_name, class: 'admin-registry-form__label' do
        %i.fa-solid.fa-id-card{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
        Display name
      = f.text_field :display_name, class: 'form-control', placeholder: 'Marketing and Communications'
      .admin-registry-form__hint
        The loader name will appear in the loader UI. Use a team or program name to differentiate it from other similar loaders.
    .mb-0
      = f.label :kind, class: 'admin-registry-form__label' do
        %i.fa-solid.fa-diagram-project{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
        Loader type
      = f.select :kind, Loader.kinds.keys.map { |k| [k.upcase, k] }, { include_blank: 'Select a loader type…' },
                 class: 'form-select', required: true
      .admin-registry-form__hint
        <strong>IPTC</strong> ingests image archives and builds MODS from embedded IPTC tags. <strong>XML</strong> ingests a <code class="admin-registry-table__id">manifest.xlsx</code> plus per-row MODS files to update existing objects or create new ones. <strong>MULTIPAGE</strong> ingests an archive whose <code class="admin-registry-table__id">manifest.xlsx</code> lists one or more items (MODS + ordered page images per item); each item becomes its own Work with ordered pages.

  .admin-registry-form__section
    %h3.admin-registry-form__section-title
      %i.fa-solid.fa-shield-halved{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
      Access
    .admin-registry-form__section-note
      %i.fa-solid.fa-circle-info{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
      The two fields below control access. Members of the Grouper group can see this loader. The root collection PID determines where files are deposited and the access permissions for those files. Changing the Grouper group or root collection PID for an existing loader will change who can see it and where it deposits files. To remove access for a loader that cannot be deleted, change the Grouper group to “northeastern:drs:repository:admin”.

    .mb-3
      = f.label :group, 'Grouper group', class: 'admin-registry-form__label' do
        %i.fa-solid.fa-user-group{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
        Grouper group
      = f.text_field :group, class: 'form-control admin-registry-form__input--id', placeholder: 'northeastern:drs:repository:loaders:marcom', autocomplete: 'off'
      .admin-registry-form__hint
        The full Grouper group path, starting with “northeastern:drs” (e.g., northeastern:drs:marketing_and_communications:staff). Members of this group will see this loader on their “My Loaders” page.

    .mb-0
      = f.label :root_collection, 'Root collection PID', class: 'admin-registry-form__label' do
        %i.fa-solid.fa-folder-open{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
        Root collection PID
      -# NOID-shaped on purpose. This read `neu:6240`, a v1 Fedora pid, which no v2
      -# collection has — so anyone copying the example's shape typed an identifier
      -# that could never resolve.
      = f.text_field :root_collection, class: 'form-control admin-registry-form__input--id', placeholder: 'e.g. 7h44jrj', autocomplete: 'off'
      .admin-registry-form__hint
        For IPTC loaders, enter the root collection PID that contains the collections the loader can deposit files into. A root collection PID is not required for XML and MULTIPAGE loaders.

  .d-flex.gap-2.align-items-center.mt-4
    = f.submit class: 'btn btn-primary'
    = link_to admin_loaders_path, class: 'btn btn-warning' do
      Cancel
